This backend uses Swiss Ephemeris via the @swisseph/node npm package, which
bundles the Swiss Ephemeris library and ephemeris data files.

Source Code
-----------
The complete source code of this backend is available in the project repository
for AGPL network-use compliance. Users interacting with this service over the
network are entitled to receive the corresponding source code.

Ephemeris Data
--------------
Ephemeris data files are bundled with the @swisseph/node package. For custom
or additional ephemeris files, see:
https://github.com/aloistr/swisseph/tree/master/ephe
